  "title": "Lantern Flood",
  "rules": [
    "Rigger spends two shared supplies to open the central sluice permanently.",
    "Medic spends one supply to stabilize an adjacent casualty and stop its countdown.",
    "Each role carries at most one casualty; paired adjacent handoff transfers to an empty receiver.",
    "Recover attempts casualty pickup before pack collection; lowest eligible index wins.",
    "Beacons last six ticks and share actual radius-two sensing with every role.",
    "Deliver carried casualties within one tile of the depot; unstabilized casualties can expire.",
    "Moves into other starting cells or shared requested destinations fail; no swaps.",
    "Both casualties resolved ends naturally; otherwise step 96 truncates. Raw terminal state absorbs."
  ],
